        "overview.prereqHtml": `<ul class="checklist"><li>PHP 8.4.27 or later in the 8.4 series, or PHP 8.5.12 and later PHP 8.x releases. PHP 8.5.0-8.5.11 and PHP 9 are outside the package constraint.</li><li>Composer</li><li>A second terminal for curl while the server keeps running</li></ul>`,
