        "overview.limitHtml": `<ul class="checklist"><li>Middleware is registered on App, not on route declarations. It can inspect the request path to restrict its behavior.</li><li>The native listener has no worker manager or event loop. Multiple listener processes need external supervision and traffic distribution.</li><li>The TCP listener leaves multipart input as a raw body. Supply parsing middleware to populate parsed fields and uploaded files.</li><li>No template engine, ORM, or session layer is bundled. Register application-selected services through providers; compatibility depends on the library and runtime.</li></ul>`,
