        "runtime.title": "Follow the request from the socket to the controller result.",
        "runtime.lede": "The native listener accepts and parses a connection, passes the request through middleware and routing, invokes the controller, and writes the response. Calling handle() directly uses the same middleware and dispatch steps without socket parsing or response emission.",
