        "runtime.stage1Title": "Raw socket to Request",
        "runtime.stage1Text": "RequestParser uses HttpOptions for the total read deadline and header/body byte limits. Defaults are five seconds, 64 KiB of headers, and 8 MiB of body. Invalid or duplicate lengths, truncated bodies, and Transfer-Encoding are rejected. An empty client stream yields no request.",
        "runtime.stage2Title": "Routing and parameter capture",
        "runtime.stage2Text": "Router compares the request method against the HttpMethod enum, walks the registered routes in order, and collects decoded :name path parameters into RouteMatch::params.",
        "runtime.stage3Title": "Controller invocation",
        "runtime.stage3Text": "App runs middleware before routing, attaches matched path parameters as request attributes, and invokes the route action through PHPInjector. Request arguments are available by concrete class and PSR request interface; responses return through the middleware in reverse order.",
        "runtime.stage4Title": "Result conversion and failures",
        "runtime.stage4Text": "Any ResponseInterface enters response middleware unchanged; other supported results become Response(200, [], body). Arrays raise AppException; non-stringable objects fail body conversion. The listener logs application errors and attempts a generic 500. ResponseEmitter buffers the body and full HTTP payload before writing. Its five-second default writeTimeout covers socket writes after serialization, not controller execution or body conversion. Write failures are logged and the connection closes.",
